  },
  "remaining": "Actual nonnegative separating exponent construction, Siegel-product modularity and precise Fourier/leading-unit formulas, peaked auxiliary existence, level-power denominator control, full reduced field action, degree/genus preservation, finite-modulus parabolic transfer, two-dimensional characteristic-zero realization, automorphy and literal higher continuation remain. Acceptance 16/20; DUB-17--20 OPEN.",
